      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: puts sock on doorknob sleeps with a blow-up doll; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a shirtless man in bed talking on a vintage telephone, with text overlays suggesting he engages in two behaviors: putting a sock on a doorknob and sleeping with a blow-up doll. The overall intent is to portray the man as absurd, lazy, or foolish through juxtaposition of mundane and bizarre actions. While not explicitly targeting any protected group, the meme relies on mocking personal habits and sexualized behavior, which can be perceived as degrading or objectifying. The humor is derived from the incongruity of the actions, but the implication of sleeping with a blow-up doll may contribute to a tone of ridicule toward personal choices or perceived lack of authenticity in relationships, potentially causing offense or discomfort to some viewers. The meme does not contain direct hate or abusive language, but its tone can be interpreted as harmful due to its potential to demean or trivialize personal behavior.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0375eabf"
